    {
      "id": "long_section",
      "question": "List all core MVP features and all suggested additional features in Executive Summary.pdf.",
      "result": {
        "answer": "- Core / MVP features: AI-produced instructional videos (with synthesized speech and optional avatar), dynamically created summaries/notes, customizable test series, and a robust question-answer engine [S1]. - Suggested additional features: Adaptive learning paths, student analytics dashboards, peer Q&A forums, and gamification elements [S1]. - AI-generated Video Lessons: Listed as a core feature (MVP) in the narrative [S1], and as an automated topic-based lecture video marked for MVP in the comparison table [S5]. - Adaptive Learning Paths: Listed as an additional feature in the narrative [S1] and suggested additional feature [S2], and marked for later phases in the comparison table [S5]. - Gamification: Listed as an additional feature in the narrative [S1] and suggested additional feature [S2], and marked for later phases in the comparison table [S5]. - Live Doubt-Solving Forum: Listed as a suggested additional feature (enabling students to post questions for AI or human tutors, with notifications and tracking) [S2]. (Note: The comparison table lists \"Q&A and Forum\" under MVP [S5], but explicitly lists \"Live Doubt-Solving Forum\" under suggested additional features [S2]). - Multilingual Support: Listed as a suggested additional feature to extend content to Hindi and other regional languages [S2], and marked for later phases in the comparison table (\"Multilingual Content: English + Hindi (e.g.) materials\") [S5]. - Offline Access & Mobile App: Listed as a suggested additional feature allowing the downloading of videos and notes for offline study [S2]. - Progress Tracking & Analytics: Listed as a suggested additional feature (dashboards showing mastery levels, time spent, and topic coverage) [S2], and as \"Performance Analytics\" (student progress dashboards, teacher reports) with MVP priority in the comparison table [S5]. - Question Bank & Q&A: Listed as a core feature (robust question-answer engine) [S1], a searchable database of Q&A by topic [S3], and included in the \"Q&A and Forum\" MVP feature in the comparison table [S5]. - Test Series & Quizzes: Listed as a core feature (customizable test series) [S1], auto-created practice tests and quizzes [S3], and \"Dynamic Test Series\" for MVP in the comparison table [S5]. - Topic-wise Notes & Summaries: Listed as a core feature (dynamically created summaries/notes) [S1], concise structured notes generated from official content [S3], and \"Topic Summaries/Notes\" for MVP in the comparison table [S5].",
